translate the question "Show the stadium name and capacity with most number of concerts in year 2014 or after." into SPARQL.

result:
```sparql
SELECT ?stadium_name ?capacity (COUNT(?concert) AS ?concert_count) 
WHERE {
  ?concert a :concert ;
             :concert\#year ?year ;
             :concert\#ref-stadium_id ?stadium .
  ?stadium a :stadium ;
             :stadium\#name ?stadium_name ;
             :stadium\#capacity ?capacity .
  FILTER(?year >= 2014)
}
GROUP BY ?stadium_name ?capacity
ORDER BY DESC(?concert_count)
LIMIT 1
```

